
> 🌍 A full-stack web application that monitors and tracks renewable energy generation from turnstile activity in real-time.

[![Built with React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-18-61DAFB?logo=react)](https://reactjs.org/)
[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-5-3178C6?logo=typescript)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)
[![Supabase](https://img.shields.io/badge/Supabase-PostgreSQL-3FCF8E?logo=supabase)](https://supabase.com/)
[![Tailwind CSS](https://img.shields.io/badge/Tailwind_CSS-3-06B6D4?logo=tailwindcss)](https://tailwindcss.com/)

---

## 📸 Overview

EcoTurnstile transforms everyday movement into measurable sustainable energy. Every time a user scans a QR code and passes through a turnstile, mechanical energy is converted into electricity — and this app tracks it all in real-time.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 📊 **Real-Time Dashboard** — Live metrics for daily scans, energy generated (kWh), and unique users
- 📈 **Interactive Analytics** — 7-day usage trends with interactive Recharts visualizations
- 📱 **QR Code Scanner** — Scan to simulate turnstile entry and generate energy
- 🖨️ **Printable QR Codes** — Generate and print QR codes for physical turnstile locations
- 🔐 **User Authentication** — Secure sign-up and login with email verification
- 👤 **User Profiles** — Personal dashboard with scan history and energy stats
- ⚡ **Auto-Refresh** — Dashboard data updates every 5 seconds automatically

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| **Frontend** | React 18, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS |
| **UI Components** | shadcn/ui, Lucide Icons |
| **Charts** | Recharts |
| **Backend** | Supabase (Auth, Realtime, Edge Functions) |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL |
| **Build Tool** | Vite |
| **QR Code** | react-qr-code |
| **Routing** | React Router v6 |

---

## 🌱 How It Works

1. 🔲 User scans a QR code at the turnstile
2. ⚡ Mechanical energy from the turnstile rotation is converted to electricity
3. 📡 Scan data is recorded in the PostgreSQL database via Supabase
4. 📊 Dashboard updates in real-time with energy metrics and analytics

